<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to publish AprIL C/A data on July 9.</title>
<headline>Hungary to publish AprIL C/A data on July 9.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary said on Monday that it was likely to publish preliminary April current account data on July 9 instead of the previously announced June 30.</p>
<p>The delay is due to the review of erroneous figures provided by some banks, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
